[Submission1.Objectives]
Stop the advance of German troops.
[Submission1.Description]
Superior enemy forces are advancing through to Istra City. The right flank of the 16th Army is falling back, under nearly overwhelming pressure. You must help stop the German offensive. 

Your orders are to:
- Stop any advance of German troops.
- Prevent the German troops from breaking through our defenses.
[Submission1.Success]
High Command’s orders have been fulfilled! You have stopped the advance of German troops.
[Submission1.Failed]
You have failed to fulfill your orders! The enemy has broken through our defenses and is advancing towards Istra City.